00:15:38,970 --> 00:15:54,970
you see that the transmittance of Zerodur significantly degrades to the point where at the wavelength of 400 nanometers that represents the violet color, we have the transmittance of about 30%.
你会看到 Zerodur 的透射率明显下降，以至于在代表紫色的 400 纳米波长处，透射率约为 30%。

110
00:15:54,970 --> 00:16:05,970
