所以这告诉我们，Zerodur 这种材料在不同波长上的透射特性非常非常不同。

111
00:16:05,970 --> 00:16:23,970
So if our goal is to create the optical component that is passing most of light in the infrared region while it is blocking a significant amount of light in the visible and ultraviolet region,
