then you would be analyzing, if you are selecting a specific optical component made out of a specific material, you would want to look at the transmission characteristic of that medium, so you would be analyzing the curves similar to those that you are seeing here on this slide.
那么你就要分析，如果你要选择用某种材料制成的某个光学元件，你就要看那种介质的透射特性，所以你会分析类似于你在这张幻灯片上看到的这些曲线。

116
