You can establish the range or width of the passband of a filter. You can change the colors. So this can serve as an introductory assignment or introductory exercise for the next lecture number five, where we are going to go and talk more about the different types of filters that you may come across
你可以设定滤光片通带的范围或宽度。你可以改变颜色。所以这可以作为下一讲，即第五讲的入门作业或入门练习，在那一讲中我们将进一步讲你可能遇到的各种类型的滤光片，

