in a typical photonics lab. So with this one, I'm going to conclude the lecture number four. Please study this material in the next lecture. As I said, we're going to go into the filters and then move further into different practical aspects of a typical photonics lab.
它们在典型的光子学实验室中都能见到。所以就这样，我来结束第四讲。请学习这些材料，在下一讲中，正如我所说，我们将讲滤光片，然后进一步讲典型光子学实验室的各种实际方面。

